   "question": "Spec 7: state the primary table (RAW-MATCHED or QUALITY-MATCHED) before inspecting TEST. All seven previous-work banks have 8838 valid outputs; N_common across the final comparison depends on later GPAT banks. Not needed before training; needed before any TEST evaluation.",
